  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOVE - support to Purposeful (new component)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOVE will resource and strengthen the women&apos;s rights movement and girls&#x2019; activism in Sierra Leone to prevent and respond to sexual and gender-based violence (SGBV). Through Purposeful&apos;s Survivor Solidarity Fund it will provide onward flexible grants to grassroots WROs and adolescent girls&#x2019; groups, provide grant accompaniment, and support movement building. The programme is intended to shift resources and decision-making power to women and girls &#x2018;closest to the ground&#x2019; to deliver effective solutions to tackle SGBV.</narrative>
  </description>
